      103  == Transportation {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      104  Specialized automobile companies, transported by bus routes for general use 35,400 passengers or 1.4 times higher than during the previous year. District is served by seven economic providers of public transport services through 12 inter-urban routes and two local routes.
