      188  == Culture {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      189  In the district there are 12 cultural centers, 17 libraries, including six for children, two music schools, art schools 3, 2 museums, 75 historical monuments. The total number of workers of culture is 150. Number of cultural groups who hold honorary title "training model" is 53. Worker's average mon
      190  == Health {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      191  The health system operates the Central hospital district, district clinic, dental clinic, hygiene and [[epidemiology]] center, rural district hospitals in villages [[Doibani]] and [[Ţîbuleuca]].
